<title>SINGAPORE: SIA appoints cabinet minister a director.</title>
<headline>SIA appoints cabinet minister a director.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Airlines (SIA) has appointed Singapore cabinet minister Lim Boon Heng, to its board of directors, state television said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The appointment of Lim, a Minister-without-Portfolio, is the first of a cabinet minister to a public-listed company in the state, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The appointment of Lim was made with the approval of Prime Minister Goh Chok Tong, in accordance with the Code of Conduct for Ministers.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsromm (+65-870-3082)</p>
